WEBVTT

00:00:01.665 --> 00:00:06.373
Open VibeSynergy. Without a session you land on the login screen.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:10.018
Enter your email address…

00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:15.642
…and your password.

00:00:15.692 --> 00:00:22.846
You are in: the start page with today's advice.

00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:26.018
Log out under Settings → Account.

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:30.522
Also handy: log in with a link by mail, or 'Forgot your password?' on the login screen.
